  "text": "24-Hour Emergency Vet | BluePearl Pet Hospital | Jacksonville, FL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Jacksonville, FL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nJacksonville, FL\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n904.646.1287\n3444 Southside Blvd. Ste. 103\nJacksonville, FL 32216\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nMon-Fri: 8 am-5 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBLUEPEARL GAINESVILLE FAMILIES: Our Gainesville and Jacksonville hospitals have united and will be serving you at our Jacksonville location! Our trusted team will continue to provide the same care you’ve come to expect.\nWe are committed to making this transition as smooth as possible for you and your pets. If you have any questions or need assistance with your pet’s medical records, please contact us.\nThank you for your continued trust and support—we look forward to continuing to care for your pets at our Jacksonville hospital.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Jacksonville and beyond.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital in Jacksonville is an emergency vet and specialty animal hospital open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, 365 days a year—even on holidays. We are located in Jacksonville and serve the beaches and southern Georgia, including Atlantic Beach, Neptune Beach, Ponte Vedra Beach, Sawgrass, Bay Meadows, Southside, Riverside, downtown Jacksonville, Arlington and more.\nPets are our passion, and keeping them healthy is our #1 priority. Here, we strive to deliver excellent care for pets. Because your pets deserve nothing less.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWe are an AAHA-accredited veterinary hospital. That means we hold ourselves to a higher standard.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency.\nIf your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\n24-hour emergency veterinarian.\nCall ahead to our 24-hour emergency vet hospital in Jacksonville and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary.\nLearn more about your emergency visit.\nSpecialty veterinary care.\nSpecialists at BluePearl veterinary hospitals work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Jacksonville.\nOur hospital is equipped with specialized tools and technology for life-saving care, including an advanced 64-slice CT scanner, MRI, ultrasound, in-house lab work, an advanced surgical suite, blood products, oxygen therapy, electrocardiogram and fluoroscopy.\nOur hospital was named “Best Animal Hospital” in\nJacksonville Magazine’s\n2019 annual reader poll.\nOur BluePearl animal hospital in Jacksonville was formerly known as Affiliated Veterinary Specialists and North Florida Veterinary Specialists.\nWe are fully equipped as a 24-hour emergency animal hospital.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n904.646.1287\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n904.646.1287\n904.645.5585\n3444 Southside Blvd.                                    Ste. 103\nJacksonville,\nFL                                    32216\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nOrlando\nMaitland, FL\n9905 S U.S. Hwy. 17-92\nMaitland, FL 32751\n407.644.1287\n114.20 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSavannah, GA\n335 Stephenson Ave\nSavannah, GA 31405\n912.354.6681\n122.37 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nTampa, FL\n3000 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa, FL 33614\n813.933.8944\n165.17 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
